    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Dominatus Event Companion",
    "summary": "If you chose Tactical Missions, shuffle the Secondary Mission deck and leave it face down. As your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins, turn up two cards from that deck to become your active missions. Once in the battle, as your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) ends, you may pay 1 CP to replace an active Secondary Mission card with one newly drawn card.",
